opal_nrp is a native Rust port of opal 3.0.0, by Bitdancer
(https://github.com/RealBitdancer/opal), and of the format readers of its example player. It
is distributed under opal's licence, which follows. opal's copyright notice is retained, and
the port's own work, Copyright (c) 2026 OctoKeights, is offered under the same terms.

opal's output resampler follows the public-domain Opal by Shayde of Reality, written for
Reality Adlib Tracker 2. The log-sine and exponent tables are the values of the Yamaha
YMF262's ROM, read from the decapped chip.

